id=exynos9611_kernel
name=Exynos 9611 kernel (Linux 4.14 with Android 17 backports)
author=tabs6-lite
description=Replaces the stock Android 13 kernel Image (which cannot boot an Android 16/17 userspace: no eBPF backports, capabilities stop at 37) with one built from source from the community universal9611 tree (lineage-24.0 branch, pinned commit), plus the patches in kernel-patches/. Only the kernel Image inside boot.img is swapped: stock ramdisk, DTB, header and dtbo.img are kept.
